### 6) Login admin-scope passenger (fallback)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth-service/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{admin_passenger_email}}",
  "password": "{{admin_passenger_password}}"
}

> {%
if (response.body && response.body.data) {
  if (response.body.data.token) {
